{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","维伦"],["/names/en","Valen"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长制造范围伤害的战士，开启强化状态后可提升作战能力。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Warrior who is skilled at dealing AoE damage and becomes stronger under his enhanced mode."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","遵命，遵命，让我来看看发生了什么——"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Yes, as you command. Now, what seems to be the problem?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不管怎么说，有进步总比停滞不前好，对吧？"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Little progress is better than no progress, right?"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","来，看着我——的每一剑。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","It's time to show you my moves!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失败也是人生的一部分……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Ah... Defeat... is just another part... of life...."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","啊哈，意料之中。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Just as I expected."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","需要帮忙吗，朋友？"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Need a hand, friend?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","奉将军之命，我会保护你，暂时如此。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The general has asked me to protect you! Not that you need it."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","这把剑暂时还没到他出场的时机呢。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Oh, this sword? It's not the right time to use it. That's all."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","所谓的剑术就是用华丽的花招混淆视线，一击绝杀。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Swordsmanship is the art of using flashy moves to distract your enemies, and then defeat them in one deadly strike!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我很喜欢——事先说明，这话可不是在奉承你。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","I actually really like it—and just to clarify, I'm not trying to flatter you."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","竟然破费给我东西？你这人很大方嘛。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Breaking the bank on something just for me? How generous!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","浪心剑客"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Roving Swordsman"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","比起将军的任务，他更在意今晚酒馆的折扣。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","The general's orders can wait. Tonight's tavern discount cannot."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","喋血特工"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Operative"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","来我身后，我会保护你立即撤离。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Stay behind me. I'll make sure you get out of here safely."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Limited Bundle"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不错，放松的好地方"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What a great place to unwind."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","报告明天再交也来得及吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Guess I can finish that report tomorrow."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这儿的推荐是什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What do you recommend here?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要来一起欣赏雪景吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's watch the snow fall together."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","想要怎样的礼物？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What kind of gift do you want this year?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要不要尝点什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Want some of this dish?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要不要一起去放焰火？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wanna set off fireworks together?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","维伦曾与为恶的领主雇佣的剑术家展开决斗，并凭借自己绝妙的技艺获得了胜利——轻松躲过剑术家狂风骤雨般的攻击，精准地砍断了对方的腰带。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Valen once had a duel with a swordsman hired by an evil lord. He skillfully won by slicing off the man's belt and pantsing him. Everyone was impressed by what they saw."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","最近维伦执行监视任务的成功率有所下降。因为他跟踪目标时，总有曾受过帮助的居民热情地向他打招呼。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Recently, Valen's clandestine missions have been less successful because the children he saved before always run up and warmly call out to him!"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","“从盗匪手中救下我的那一刻，维伦先生那潇洒的英姿就深深地印刻在我的脑海中了。”——圣石镇居民，玛丽小姐"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","\"Ever since Sir Valen rescued me from those awful bandits, his dashing image has been etched into my mind. I even dreamt of him a few times. Don't tell my husband.\" —Mrs. Mary, a resident of Holistone"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","旅人灯火的服务生透露，维伦曾在他面前用过9种不同的动作翻转手腕，舞出剑花。而他自己尝试偷学时，练习剑脱手飞出，直戳进了酒馆标志性的大木桶里。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","When a waiter at the Traveler's Light tried one of Valen's signature moves, the sword flew out of his hand and poked a hole in the tavern's iconic barrel, almost slicing off the head of the patron that was sitting next to it."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","维伦曾经帮助村民铲除危险的恶霸，村民们集资作为报酬，维伦只接受了一枚鸡蛋。据他自己说，这是他最喜爱的食物。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Valen once removed a local gangster for some villagers, who put together their savings as his reward. However, he refused their gift and instead asked for a basket of eggs. He told them he loves omelets and egg muffins."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","一名黑赌场的老板入狱后大惊失色，他发现自己面前的审讯者维伦竟然就是当初连胜自己数局的顾客。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","The owner of an underground gambling house was shocked when he discovered that the person who arrested him was none other than Valen, a regular at poker tables. \"If you start a poker club in prison, let me know.\" Valen smiled innocently."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","“我们私底下讨论很久了，但没人知道真相。霍根将军当年到底是怎么抓住队长的啊？”——隐士某成员。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","\"We've discussed it for a while, but no one knows the full story. How on earth did General Hogan catch the captain?\" —A member of the Solitaries"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“维伦这小子，远比你看到的要可靠得多。”——霍根。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","\"Valen is more reliable than he looks. He once fought off a group of brigands with a mop and a pot lid.\" —General Hogan"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","圣石镇的女孩们会聚在一起谈论维伦的情史，却从没有人见过他真的把女孩拿下。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","The girls in Holistone often gather to gossip about Valen's love life. However, none of them admitted to actually having seen him with a lady. It makes one wonder what they're really gossiping about."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","失踪的宝剑“咏雷者”至今下落不明，据黑市商人的供词，他们曾在当晚的拍卖会上见过肖似维伦的身影。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","The infamous sword \"Stormcaller\" is still missing to this day. According to some illicit peddlers, they claimed to have seen someone resembling Valen at an auction one night. When asked, Valen replied, \"There are a lot of handsome guys in Esperia.\""],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，科丝蒂小姐应该是正式经受过培训的魔法师吧？\n咒语和研究方法看起来都很专业。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Miss Cassadee, you must be a properly trained mage.\nYour spells and research methods look very professional."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 科丝蒂 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Cassadee & Valen"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Holistone"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Golden Wheatshire"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","那个维拉夫人，到底是什么来头……"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","What's the deal with this Lady Vala...?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411040.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10411040.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 维拉"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Valen & Vala"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Holistone"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Golden Wheatshire"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","唔……肚子饿了。漫漫，你那里有什么好吃的？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Ugh... So hungry. Hammie, do you have anything to eat?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411050.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10411050.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Hammie & Valen"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Holistone"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Golden Wheatshire"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/2/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/2/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/3/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/3/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","真想找时间去喝上一杯。"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","I need a drink."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411060.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10411060.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Valen & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Holistone"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Golden Wheatshire"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/2/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/2/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","金穗村的季度粮食产量，确认。\n综合收购方案第三款，确认。\n金穗村及格罗登平原全域道路保障及维护，确认。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Ryeham's seasonal food production, confirmed.\nClause 3 of the Comprehensive Purchase Plan, confirmed.\nRoad assurance and maintenance of Ryeham and the entire Golden Wheatshire region, confirmed."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415022.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415022.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","罗万 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Rowan & Valen"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","不错，放松的好地方"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","What a great place to unwind."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415058.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415058.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Valen"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","这儿的推荐是什么？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","What do you recommend here?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415059.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415059.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Valen"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","外面居然下起雪来了，倒是很有氛围嘛。"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","It's actually starting to snow outside. This really sets the mood."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415341.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415341.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 米瑞尔"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Valen & Mirael"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","要来一起欣赏雪景吗？"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Let's watch the snow fall together."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415363.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415363.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Valen"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","想要怎样的礼物？"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","What kind of gift do you want this year?"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415364.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415364.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Valen"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","要不要尝点什么？"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Want some of this dish?"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415533.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415533.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Valen"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","要不要一起去放焰火？"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Wanna set off fireworks together?"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415534.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415534.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Valen"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","真巧，这不是替霍根将军暂时代管骑士团日常事务的维伦先生吗。"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Ah, if it isn't Sir Valen, General Hogan's trusted right hand. The very man overseeing the daily affairs of the Heroic Order."],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415662.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415662.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","伊芙 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Evie & Valen"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","维伦，这里有一个调查走私线路的长期任务。"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Valen, there's a long-term assignment here involving the investigation of smuggling routes."],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415771.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415771.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","埃德加 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Eryndor & Valen"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","唔唔，我脸上的毛毛是不是有点脏了呀……"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","Hmm, is there a bit of dirt on my face?"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414010.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414010.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满 & 卢修斯 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Chippy & Lucius & Valen"],["/interaction_records/14/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/14/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","那——么，在闪耀的红宝石之下，打起精神来吧！"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","Under the ruby's shining hue, kindle the fervor, spirits renew!"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414030.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414030.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 维伦 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Fay & Valen & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","圣堂的骑士也是不容易啊。"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","Being a knight of the Temple is not easy."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414060.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414060.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 卢修斯"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Valen & Lucius"],["/interaction_records/16/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/16/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","没想到，你身手居然这么快……"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","I didn't expect you to be so quick with your hands..."],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414100.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414100.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Atalanta & Valen"]]}